---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import ScreenshotSlot from '../../../components/ScreenshotSlot.astro';
import TransportPlanner from '../../../components/TransportPlanner.astro';
import WorkshopLinks from '../../../components/WorkshopLinks.astro';
import art from '../../../assets/projects/transport.png';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<SiteLayout title="Automated Public Transport Planning" description="A Cities: Skylines 1 Development prototype for bus route proposals and confirmed creation attempts. Game acceptance is pending." locale="zh-tw" path="automated-public-transport-planning/" active="mods">
	<section class="hero page-wrap">
		<div class="hero-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow" lang="en">Mod 02 · Development prototype</p>
			<h1>Automated Public Transport Planning</h1>
			<p class="hero-lead" lang="en">The Development prototype can preview proposed bus lines and attempt to create a selected route after you arm the feature and confirm. Creation may change a save, and runnable routes are not guaranteed.</p>
			<div class="status-strip" lang="en"><span class="tag">May change saves</span><span class="tag">Confirmation required</span><span class="tag">Game acceptance pending</span></div>
			<WorkshopLinks mod="transport" locale="zh-tw" />
		</div>
		<figure class="hero-art"><Image src={art} alt="Automated Public Transport Planning artwork" widths={[560, 720]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 45vw" format="webp" quality={78} loading="eager" /><figcaption class="art-note">專案美術圖 · 並非遊戲截圖</figcaption></figure>
	</section>

	<nav class="subnav page-wrap" aria-label="Automated Public Transport Planning guide"><a href={base + 'zh-tw/wiki/transport/overview/'}>使用說明</a><a href={base + 'zh-tw/wiki/project/roadmap/'}>路線圖</a></nav>

	<section class="section soft">
		<div class="page-wrap columns">
			<div class="text-stack">
				<p class="eyebrow" lang="en">Diagnostics and planning</p>
				<h2 lang="en">Survey, preview and review.</h2>
				<p lang="en">The mod can survey roads, stops and the transit network. These survey diagnostics do not create routes; the separate Development route-creation prototype can change the city after confirmation. Diagnostics results are written to the game log:</p>
				<ul class="feature-list">
					<li><strong>量測規劃成本</strong><span>估算在你的城市上規劃需要多少時間（會短暫停頓）。</span></li>
					<li><strong>擷取世界快照</strong><span>規劃器會用到的道路與站點摘要。</span></li>
					<li><strong>建立路線圖</strong><span>各站點之間可能的連接網絡。</span></li>
				</ul>
				<p lang="en">Back up saves and use a separate test city. Successful route creation and save/reload have not been established in subscribed-game acceptance.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="screenshot-stack">
				<ScreenshotSlot locale="zh-tw" title="模組選項中的診斷工具" description="選項頁上的語言選擇與診斷按鈕。" />
				<ScreenshotSlot locale="zh-tw" title="記錄中的調查結果" description="城市載入或執行診斷後，寫入遊戲記錄的摘要。" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Browser illustration is not an in-game screenshot. OpenAI-Codex_Responsible: Modpack_Website. -->
	<section class="interactive-section"><div class="page-wrap"><p class="section-label">規劃概念 · 網頁互動示意</p><h2>從需求到你核准的公車路線。</h2><TransportPlanner locale="zh-tw" /></div></section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="page-wrap columns">
			<div class="text-stack"><p class="eyebrow">路線圖</p><h2>一步一步來。</h2><p lang="en">The Development prototype is experimental and can damage saves. Back up before testing and confirm each creation attempt.</p><a class="text-link" href={base + 'zh-tw/wiki/project/roadmap/'}>完整路線圖 →</a></div>
			<div class="roadmap" lang="en"><article><strong>Survey</strong><p>Read-only network survey and diagnostics.</p></article><article><strong>Preview</strong><p>Development proposals estimate candidate bus routes.</p></article><article><strong>Attempt creation</strong><p>Arm the feature and confirm a selected proposal. Game acceptance remains pending.</p></article></div>
		</div>
	</section>
</SiteLayout>
<!-- Author: OpenAI-Codex_Responsible: Modpack_Website. -->
